Domain of $g(x) = \sqrt{x}$ is $x \ge 0$. $\therefore$ this is the domain of $f(g(x))$.

$f(g(x)) = (\sqrt{x})^4 - 2(\sqrt{x})^2 = x^2 - 2x,\ (x \ge 0)$

